                "4. Geocentric Orientation (Global Synthesis / Glocalization): The pinnacle of international marketing sophistication. The geocentric enterprise views the entire world as a single interconnected marketplace, transcending national and regional biases. It embraces the philosophy of 'Glocalization': Think Globally, Act Locally. The firm creates a standardized, modular global core product platform (capturing massive global R&D and manufacturing scale) while granting regional marketing teams the autonomy to execute tactical local adaptations (customizing flavors, localized advertising narratives, and local distribution channels).",
